sg-wait-preview
sg-assert-preview
sg-close Assets/ShaderGraphs/LaunchNight/NightShift.shadergraph
wait 10
play
wait 120
assert-playing 1
assert-audio Storm Sound | 1
assert-audio Room Tone | 1
assert-audio Fire Sound | 1
assert-audio Fire Alarm | 1
assert-audio Typing Sound | 1
assert-audio Snoring | 1
assert-audio Coffee Sound | 1
assert-audio Panel Buzz | 1
assert-field Main Camera | Transform.Position | != [14.2, 2, 19.6]
stop
assert-playing 0
assert-audio Storm Sound | 0
wait 10
